  - upgradeType: 12
    displayName: DOUBLE SHOT
    customDescription: Fires two projectiles at the same target. Each projectile
      deals reduced damage and the attack takes longer to prepare.
    bonusPercent: 0
    maximumStacks: 1
  - upgradeType: 13
    displayName: RICOCHET
    customDescription: Projectiles bounce to additional enemies. Further stacks improve
      the number of targets and ricochet damage.
    bonusPercent: 0
    maximumStacks: 1
  - upgradeType: 14
    displayName: POISON
    customDescription: Projectile hits can poison enemies and deal damage over time.
      Ricochet hits have a lower chance to apply poison.
    bonusPercent: 0
    maximumStacks: 1
  - upgradeType: 15
    displayName: STUN
    customDescription: Projectile hits can briefly stop enemies. A second stack increases
      the stun duration.
    bonusPercent: 0
    maximumStacks: 1
  - upgradeType: 16
    displayName: SLOW
    customDescription: Projectile hits slow enemy movement. A second stack increases
      the movement reduction.
    bonusPercent: 0
    maximumStacks: 1
